  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2d34769bfeb3d848df77d518567555ce6be226b3eaac381034b82c3051868436.png] \n\n**Given equation: **16 ÷ 4 + 8 - 3 × 2 = 31\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1. ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 16 ÷ 4 + 8 − 3 × 2 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 16 − 4 + **__8 ÷ 3__** × 2 = 31\n\n⇒ 16 − 4 + **__2.67 × 2__** = 31\n\n⇒ __**16**__ − 4 __**+ 5.33**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**21.33 - 4**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 17.33 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2. + and ×\n\nGiven: 16 ÷ 4 + 8 − 3 × 2 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 8 − 3 + 2 = 31\n\n⇒ __**4 × 8**__ − 3 + 2 = 31\n\n⇒ **__32__ **− 3 __**+ 2**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**34 - 3**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 31 = 31\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n3. × and ÷\n\nGiven: 16 ÷ 4 + 8 − 3 × 2 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 16 × 4 + 8 − __3 ÷ 2__ = 31\n\n⇒ **__16 × 4__** + 8 − 1.5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**64 + 8**__ − 1.5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**72 − 1.5**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 70.5 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4. - and ×\n\nGiven: 16 ÷ 4 + 8 − 3 × 2 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 8 × 3 − 2 = 31\n\n⇒ 4 + __**8 × 3**__ − 2 = 31\n\n⇒ __**4 + 24**__ − 2 = 31\n\n⇒ __**28 − 2**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 26 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
